        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Woodstock, Canaan, Cushman, Berlin, Dorchester, Maine border\n- Roads: New Hampshire Route 118\n- Regions: White Mountains Region, Upper Valley region\n- Buildings: Dorchester Community Church\n\nFacts:\n- New Hampshire Route 118 stretches from Woodstock in the White Mountains Region south to Canaan in the Upper Valley region.\n- The White Mountains Region northern boundary begins at Cushman, runs to Berlin, and then continues east to the Maine border.\n- The Dorchester Community Church is a historic church building located off New Hampshire Route 118 in Dorchester, New Hampshire.",
